# OneOhm EPC — Cursor Rules

> **Detailed context-aware rules are in `.cursor/rules/`**

## Quick Reference

**Before ANY code:**
1. Search existing code — never duplicate
2. Read related files — understand context
3. Follow existing patterns exactly

**Tech Stack:**
- Backend: NestJS + TypeORM + PostgreSQL
- Frontend: Next.js 15 + React 19 + TanStack Query
- Shared: `@oneohm-epc/shared` (sub-paths: `/types`, `/utils`, `/schemas`, `/constants`)

**Core Rules:**
- Repository pattern — no TypeORM in services
- Shared types go in `@oneohm-epc/shared/types`, app-specific types stay in app
- Multi-org support — always filter by organizationId
- Pagination required — never fetch all data
- Soft delete — always check `deletedAt IS NULL`

**Quality Bar:**
- Strict TypeScript (no `any`)
- Handle loading/error/empty states
- Clean, readable, production-ready
